"evidence": "For the mortgage reset and refinance comparison, Liora asked for a side-by-side review of the current adjustable mortgage against fixed-rate and shorter-term refinance quotes, including closing costs, monthly payment impact, and the point at which refinancing would offset upfront costs; the agreed follow-up is due 2025-06-03.",
"action": "Prepare side‑by‑side mortgage vs refinance quote analysis and deliver by 2025‑06‑03."
