{
"evidence": "For loan reset timing analysis, the mortgage servicer’s notice shows an upcoming rate change window, and the household wants a recommendation early enough to decide whether to lock a refinance quote or remain with the current lender; the agreed follow-up is due 2025-05-30.",
"action": "Provide recommendation on loan reset timing to guide refinance decision by 2025‑05‑30."
},
{
"evidence": "For HELOC document collection, the portal file contains only a partial HELOC statement, and the missing pages include the margin, draw-period terms, and repayment conversion language needed to model the combined debt picture; the agreed follow-up is due 2025-05-20.",
"action": "Obtain the missing HELOC statement pages (margin, draw‑period terms, repayment conversion) and deliver by 2025‑05‑20."
},
{
"evidence": "For the cash-flow discrepancy review, the mortgage servicer’s escrow estimate and Liora’s household budget show different monthly property tax and insurance amounts, creating uncertainty in the projected payment after the loan reset; the agreed follow-up is due 2025-05-27.",
"action": "Analyze and reconcile escrow estimate vs budget property tax and insurance amounts, report findings by 2025‑05‑27."
},
{
"evidence": "For the bank autopay issue and reserve protection, Liora reported that Teacup Comet Bank drafted the HELOC autopay twice in one cycle, temporarily reducing the checking account cushion and forcing a transfer from savings before payroll posted; the agreed follow-up is due 2025-05-21.",
"action": "Investigate duplicate HELOC autopay, coordinate with Teacup Comet Bank, and propose reserve protection solution by 2025‑05‑21."
},
{
"evidence": "For the debt repayment funding review, a portfolio review showed that selling enough Cloudberry Kite Robotics shares to pay off the credit card balance and part of the auto loan could reduce concentration risk, but the tax lots vary significantly by holding period and unrealized gain; the agreed follow-up is due 2025-06-10.",
"action": "Conduct tax‑lot analysis of Cloudberry Kite Robotics shares and recommend share‑sale strategy for debt repayment by 2025‑06‑10."
}
